Objective: Be the first to attain an eco-sphere rating of 500

Planet: Flash Point
Clan: 7 Knights

Notes: You start with many constructors, engineers, and refineries already available. All you need to do is find and mine plenty of gold and it should be no trouble to create a force to wrest control of this world from the Sacred Eight. Unfortunately, this is a low density world. Gold seems very hard to find.

